==Battleground==
*1 [[Gabriel]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*1 [[Heavenly Hippoe]] spawns after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*1 [[Malizabeth]] spawns after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[High Countess Koryessa]] spawns as the boss.
**2 [[Gory Dark]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 73.33~80 seconds<sup>2,200f~2,400f</sup>.
**2 [[Heavenly Hippoe]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 86.67~93.33 seconds<sup>2,600f~2,800f</sup>.
**3 [[Malizabeth]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 53.33~60 seconds<sup>1,600f~1,800f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
**1 [[Baron Face]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Use Heavenly Hippoe to build up a massive amount of [[Goggles Cat (Special Cat)|Green Nyanko Rangers]], [[Scarf Cat (Special Cat)|Red Nyanko Rangers]], and [[Fedora Cat (Special Cat)|Blue Nyanko Rangers]]. Using [[Helmet Cat (Special Cat)|Yellow Nyanko Ranger]] as a tank, you should be able to overwhelm Baron Face and kill him almost instantly, leaving just High Countess Koryessa. She poses basically no threat even with the remaining support. It's only a matter of time until she dies.

